          {
            "source_rev": "80b5a290df3d2ade",
            "packet_id": "93716e1f2fc0235ffb4cba3396cf5408d227a275cddf163ed1e8b643696c5278",
            "locator": "document",
            "quote": "锂电箔单万吨的设备投资，我说的是主设备，大概在2.5到3个亿",
